TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_5C74_7889';
<p>5c74_7889</p> <h4>Two-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a two-point test cross examines two (2) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard two-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for both genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for both genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for two genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #276f1a;">Gene A</span></strong> is linked with the '<span style="color: #276f1a;"><i>artsy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #276f1a;">Gene A</span> has wings that are colorful and distinctive patterns.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #8c3c75;">Gene K</span></strong> is analogous to the '<span style="color: #8c3c75;"><i>kidney</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #8c3c75;">Gene K</span> has a body shape that is curved, similar to a kidney bean.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="2" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">artsy, kidney</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d6f4d2; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">a</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe1ee; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">2,756</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">artsy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d6f4d2; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">a</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8c3c75;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">1,621</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">kidney</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #276f1a;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe1ee; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">1,635</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #276f1a;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8c3c75;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">2,788</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="3" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">8,800</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>Review the phenotype counts shown in the table. Based on the traits expressed in the offspring, identify the possible <strong>recombinant genotype combinations</strong>. These allele combinations have occurred due to genetic crossover. More than one combination will be correct. Select all that apply.</p>
PROMPT_5C74_7889
loadMacros('parserCheckboxList.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_5C74_7889_CHOICE_1';
ak
LITERAL_5C74_7889_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_5C74_7889_CHOICE_2';
a+
LITERAL_5C74_7889_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_5C74_7889_CHOICE_3';
+k
LITERAL_5C74_7889_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_5C74_7889_CHOICE_4';
++
LITERAL_5C74_7889_CHOICE_4
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_5C74_7889_CORRECT_1';
a+
LITERAL_5C74_7889_CORRECT_1
$correct_2 = <<'LITERAL_5C74_7889_CORRECT_2';
+k
LITERAL_5C74_7889_CORRECT_2
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4);
@correct = ($correct_1, $correct_2);
$answer = CheckboxList([@choices], [@correct], labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->checks\}
END_TEXT
